.\n4. **PR:** I opened [#101](https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101) against main. Opening it didn't add any reviewers, so I requested a review from `code-owner` separately.\n5. **Merge:** As required for main, the merge went to a code owner for approval. They approved it (\"Looks right.\"), and #101 is now merged into main.\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory tool didn't recognise it. I went by the docstring and the test, which both say banker's rounding.", "type": "text"}]}]}